## Ket qua nghien cuu scraping Netflix TUDUM

### Phat hien

| URL | Ket qua |
|-----|---------|
| `netflix.com/tudum/top10/vietnam` | HTML khong chua movie titles - chi co `#N in Movies` + watch URLs |
| `top10.netflix.com/` | Tuong tu - co views count nhung khong co ten phim |
| Ca 2 trang | Co Netflix watch IDs, week labels, rank numbers, image URLs (trong CSS) |

### Scraping Strategy (3-tier fallback - DA CHOT)

```
Priority 1: TUDUM Direct/JSON
  -> Tim `__NEXT_DATA__` JSON trong page source
  -> Hoac tim hidden API endpoint ma TUDUM goi (Network tab)
  -> Uu: Nhe, nhanh, khong can install gi
  -> Nhuoc: Co the thay doi bat cu luc nao

Priority 2: FlixPatrol.com
  -> Scrape tu flixpatrol.com/top10/netflix/vietnam
  -> Du lieu structured hon TUDUM
  -> Uu: Du lieu ro rang, co ten phim
  -> Nhuoc: Ben thu 3, co the block

Priority 3: Puppeteer (last resort)
  -> Headless Chrome render TUDUM page
  -> Parse DOM sau khi JS render xong
  -> Uu: Chac chan parse duoc moi thu
  -> Nhuoc: Can install Chromium (~200MB), cham
```

