**Bang diem chi tiet:**

| Dieu kien | Diem | Vi du |
|-----------|------|-------|
| Ten chinh xac (normalized) | +100 | query "bo gia" -> movie "Bo Gia" |
| Slug khop query | +95 | query "bo-gia" -> slug "bo-gia" |
| Ten bat dau bang query | +70 | query "bo" -> "Bo Gia" |
| Original name khop | +60 | query "parasite" -> originalName "Parasite" |
| Original name bat dau | +55 | query "para" -> "Parasite" |
| Chua nguyen cum tu | +50 | query "cuoc doi" -> "Cuoc Doi Tuoi Dep" |
| Original name chua cum tu | +45 | query "dark" -> "The Dark Knight" |
| Tu don le match | +10/tu | query "hanh dong" -> "Hanh" +10, "Dong" +10 |
| Match trong fields phu (cast, genre, director) | +20 | query "Tom Hanks" -> casts field |
| Partial match fields phu | +3/tu | |
| Netflix Top 10 VN bonus | +10 | Phim dang trong Top 10 |

**Implementation:**
```typescript
export function scoreMovie(movie, normalizedQuery, queryTokens): number
export function normalizeForSearch(str: string): string
export function tokenize(str: string): string[]
```

**Acceptance criteria:**
- Tim "bo gia" -> Bo Gia xuat hien dau tien
- Tim "parasite" -> Ky Sinh Trung (original name match) xuat hien cao
- Tim "Tom Hanks" -> Tat ca phim co Tom Hanks

