### Phase 4: Netflix Top 10 Scraper
**Effort:** ~3 gio | **Risk:** Cao | **Dependencies:** Phase 1 (schema)

#### 4.1 - Schema: bang `NetflixTop10`

```prisma
model NetflixTop10 {
  id              String   @id @default(cuid())
  country         String   @default("vietnam")
  type            String                          // "movie" | "tv"
  weekLabel       String                          // "2026-W22" (ISO week)
  rank            Int                             // 1..10

  // Du lieu tu Netflix
  netflixTitle    String
  normalizedTitle String
  imageUrl        String?
  netflixUrl      String?
  netflixId       String?

  // Matching voi DB noi bo
  matchedMovieSlug String?
  matchStatus      String  @default("pending")    // "matched" | "pending" | "not_found"
  matchScore       Float?

  createdAt       DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt       DateTime @updatedAt

  matchedMovie    Movie?   @relation(fields: [matchedMovieSlug], references: [slug])

  @@unique([country, type, weekLabel, rank])
  @@index([country, type, weekLabel])
  @@index([matchedMovieSlug])
}

// Movie model them:
// netflixTop10  NetflixTop10[]
```

#### 4.2 - Tai sao bang rieng?

| Van de | Field trong Movie | Bang rieng |
|--------|:-----------------:|:----------:|
| Lich su theo tuan | Mat | Giu duoc |
| Phim Netflix chua co trong DB | Khong luu duoc | matchedMovieSlug = null |
| Phim rot Top 10 | Phai reset field | Tuan moi = row moi |
| Query lich su rank | Khong duoc | WHERE weekLabel = ... |

#### 4.3 - Luong cap nhat

```
Cron thu 2 / Manual trigger
  |
  v
POST /api/seed/top10
  |
  v
[Thu Priority 1: TUDUM JSON]
  |-- Thanh cong --> Parse title/rank/image/url
  |-- That bai ---|
                  v
[Thu Priority 2: FlixPatrol]
  |-- Thanh cong --> Parse title/rank
  |-- That bai ---|
                  v
[Thu Priority 3: Puppeteer]
  |-- Thanh cong --> Parse title/rank/image/url
  |-- That bai --> Log error, return
  |
  v
Luu vao NetflixTop10 theo weekLabel
  |
  v
Normalize title
  |
  v
Fuzzy match voi Movie trong DB (string-similarity > 0.8)
  |
  +-- Score > 0.8 --> matchStatus = "matched"
  +-- 0.5 < Score < 0.8 --> matchStatus = "pending"
  +-- Score < 0.5 --> matchStatus = "not_found"
```

#### 4.4 - API endpoints

| Endpoint | Method | Mo ta |
|----------|--------|-------|
| `POST /api/seed/top10` | POST | Scrape + luu + auto-match. Query: `?source=tudum\|flixpatrol\|puppeteer` (optional force source) |
| `GET /api/top10` | GET | Lay Top 10 tuan hien tai. Query: `?week=2026-W22&type=movie&country=vietnam` |
| `POST /api/top10/rematch` | POST | Re-match cac entry pending/not_found (chay sau khi seed phim moi) |

#### 4.5 - Hien thi card Top 10

```
Neu matchedMovieSlug co gia tri:
    -> Card phim tu DB (poster, ten VN, click de xem trong app)
    -> So rank lon ben trai (kieu Netflix)

Neu matchedMovieSlug = null:
    -> Card voi imageUrl tu Netflix (hoac placeholder)
    -> Ten Netflix goc (netflixTitle)
    -> Badge "Chua co tren Localflix"
    -> Click -> mo netflixUrl (external link) hoac disabled
```

#### 4.6 - Dependencies

| Package | Muc dich | Khi nao install |
|---------|----------|-----------------|
| `string-similarity` | Fuzzy matching title | Luon can |
| `puppeteer` | Fallback cuoi cung | Chi khi Priority 1+2 fail |

**Acceptance criteria:**
- POST `/api/seed/top10` luu duoc 10 movies + 10 TV shows cho tuan hien tai
- GET `/api/top10` tra ve dung data
- Phim da co trong DB duoc auto-match
- Phim chua co hien thi voi matchStatus = "pending" hoac "not_found"

